# Copy this file to .dev.vars (same folder, keep the exact name) and paste your TMDB token.
# Get a free key: https://www.themoviedb.org/ → Settings → API → Developer.
# Both forms work:
#   TMDB_TOKEN="a1b2c3d4..."        (v3 api key string)
#   TMDB_TOKEN="eyJhbGciOi..."      (v4 read-access token, starts with ey)
# The Movies tab lights up the moment this file exists and npm run dev is restarted.
TMDB_TOKEN=""
